  "caveats": [
    "Draw counts do not imply castability or win rates.",
    "The two decks have exactly the same lands and six rocks; hence ramp-only outcomes are identical by construction.",
    "Ramp-only sequences ignore playing creatures, interaction, cantrips, additional mana from Storm-Kiln Artist/Sorcerer Class, artifact tutoring, and opponents; one ramp artifact cast per turn.",
    "Multi-land color selection assumes available opponent colors for Exotic Orchard and Fellwar Stone, and simplified modal-land/signet handling.",
    "Raw access assumes no mulligans or additional card draw; Jace, Kitsa, Scroll Rack, Whispers, and gateway effects are not resolved.",
    "Cryptic Gateway coaccess needs hand creatures and two compatible untapped creatures; listed rates are a weak upper bound."
  ]
